  "bodyHash": "e8f7297ec9be53d6",
  "content": "<h1>🛠️ 使用 Create 的力量製作破碎的方塊!</h1>\n<p>想要用<strong>Chipped</strong>方塊來點綴你的建造，但又熱愛用<strong>Create</strong>進行自動化製作？這個模組將兩個世界的最佳結合！<br><strong>現在你可以利用 Create 模組的機械和機制來製作 Chipped 方塊。</strong>是時候讓美學自動化了!</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>🔧 需求</h2>\n<p>要使用此模組，您必須同時安裝<strong>Create</strong>和<strong>Chipped</strong>模組。請選擇您的版本：</p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/static/images/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + Forge (1.20.1 和 1.19.2)</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BrayDog2010/devins-badges/ab6c523498e18dcf2d63411e7522aa3a27d0a84c/assets/cozy/requires/chipped_forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Chipped Forge\"></a></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://fabricmc.net/assets/favicon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + Fabric (1.20.1 和 1.19.2)</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create-fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create Fabric\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BrayDog2010/devins-badges/ab6c523498e18dcf2d63411e7522aa3a27d0a84c/assets/cozy/requires/chipped_fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Chipped Fabric\"></a></p>\n<h3><img src=\"https://neoforged.net/img/authors/neoforged.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + NeoForge (1.21.1 和 1.20.1) 仍然需要 Chipped 但沒有圖標</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create NeoForge\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📦 其他下載位置</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafting-recipes-for-create\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Curseforge\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📦 來源與問題追蹤</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/BrayDog2010/Crafting-Recipes-For-Create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"Github\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>無縫整合 Chipped 方塊到 Create 模組的製作系統中</li>\n<li>兼容 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge 載入器</li>\n<li>Minecraft 版本<strong>1.20.1</strong>、<strong>1.19.2</strong>和<strong>1.21.1 (僅限 NeoForge)</strong></li>\n<li>適合建造者與自動化愛好者</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬 \"為何要手動製作方塊，何不透過工程將其化為現實？\"</p>",
